WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.773 --> 00:00:15.204
Wukong is right,” said Bajie.

2
00:00:15.224 --> 00:00:19.348
“We should all go home and forget about reaching the Western Paradise.

3
00:00:22.751 --> 00:00:25.494
I’ll return to my cave and take a nice long nap.”

4
00:00:26.274 --> 00:00:27.796
Bajie started to walk away.

5
00:00:29.768 --> 00:00:30.789
Wujing grabbed him.

6
00:00:30.809 --> 00:00:32.190
“Are you crazy?”

7
00:00:32.851 --> 00:00:33.832
He looked at Wukong.

8
00:00:33.852 --> 00:00:35.673
“We can’t go home!”

9
00:00:35.693 --> 00:00:38.536
“I know that,” said the monkey.

10
00:00:38.556 --> 00:00:41.238
“I wasn’t serious about going home.

11
00:00:42.639 --> 00:00:43.940
But I’m angry with Master.

12
00:00:44.781 --> 00:00:47.083
How many times have I warned him about demons?

13
00:00:48.604 --> 00:00:49.605
He never believes me!

14
00:00:51.687 --> 00:00:54.269
If he had listened to me earlier, he wouldn’t have been kidnapped.”

15
00:00:56.651 --> 00:00:57.672
Wukong sighed.

16
00:00:58.164 --> 00:01:00.225
“We need to figure out where the demon took him.

17
00:01:01.305 --> 00:01:02.725
I’ll summon a local spirit.”

18
00:01:03.526 --> 00:01:06.246
The monkey closed his eyes and muttered some words.

19
00:01:07.307 --> 00:01:10.668
A soft breeze blew, and then a spirit appeared.

20
00:01:10.688 --> 00:01:15.129
“Hello, Sun Wukong,” said the spirit.

21
00:01:15.149 --> 00:01:17.870
“I am the spirit of this mountain.”

22
00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:21.871
“Our master was kidnapped by a demon,” said Wukong.

23
00:01:21.891 --> 00:01:25.052
“We think the demon lives near here, but we don’t know where.”

24
00:01:26.456 --> 00:01:28.298
“Oh dear,” said the spirit.

25
00:01:28.978 --> 00:01:29.939
He looked nervous.

26
00:01:29.959 --> 00:01:35.364
“Your master was probably kidnapped by Red Boy, a very nasty demon.

27
00:01:36.825 --> 00:01:39.267
His cave is near the peak of that mountain.”

28
00:01:40.007 --> 00:01:42.530
The spirit pointed to a nearby mountain.

29
00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:46.513
“You shouldn’t go there though,” the spirit continued.

30
00:01:46.533 --> 00:01:49.135
“Red Boy is very powerful.

31
00:01:50.016 --> 00:01:54.780
His father is the Bull Demon King, one of the most horrible demons ever.”

32
00:01:57.108 --> 00:02:01.371
A smile spread across Wukong’s face, and he began to laugh.

33
00:02:01.391 --> 00:02:04.132
“That is good news!”

34
00:02:05.113 --> 00:02:07.094
Everyone looked at the monkey in surprise.

35
00:02:07.114 --> 00:02:10.036
“Why is that good news?”

36
00:02:10.436 --> 00:02:11.277
asked Wujing.

37
00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:14.399
“The Bull Demon King is an old friend of mine!”

38
00:02:14.679 --> 00:02:15.379
said Wukong.

39
00:02:15.399 --> 00:02:20.222
“Before I caused trouble in Heaven, I was friends with a group of demon kings.

40
00:02:21.543 --> 00:02:23.024
The Bull Demon King was one of them.

41
00:02:24.172 --> 00:02:27.974
When I tell Red Boy who I am, he’ll release the Tang Monk right away!”

42
00:02:29.955 --> 00:02:34.156
The three travelers said good-bye to the spirit and headed up the mountain.

43
00:02:35.857 --> 00:02:37.678
They came to a cave near the peak.

44
00:02:40.199 --> 00:02:41.379
The door was closed.

45
00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:43.901
Wukong knocked.

46
00:02:44.681 --> 00:02:45.661
“Open up, Red Boy.

47
00:02:45.921 --> 00:02:46.882
I need to speak with you!”

48
00:02:48.783 --> 00:02:51.584
The door flew open, and Red Boy stepped out.

49
00:02:55.212 --> 00:02:55.892
“Who are you?”

50
00:02:56.173 --> 00:02:57.193
demanded Red Boy.

51
00:02:57.213 --> 00:02:58.914
“What do you want?”

52
00:02:59.815 --> 00:03:02.656
“You kidnapped our master, the Tang Monk,” said the monkey.

53
00:03:02.676 --> 00:03:04.637
“Please return him to us.”

54
00:03:05.818 --> 00:03:06.798
Red Boy snorted.

55
00:03:06.818 --> 00:03:09.680
“I’m not going to return the Tang Monk to you.

56
00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:12.181
I’m going to eat him and live forever.

57
00:03:13.102 --> 00:03:15.583
Now go away before I get very angry!”

58
00:03:18.945 --> 00:03:19.825
Wukong laughed.

59
00:03:20.546 --> 00:03:24.068
“My dear boy, you don’t realize whom you’re talking to.

60
00:03:25.348 --> 00:03:27.469
I am Sun Wukong—the Monkey King.

61
00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:31.011
Your father and I are old friends.”

62
00:03:31.031 --> 00:03:33.793
“I don’t care who you are!”

63
00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:34.754
said Red Boy.

64
00:03:34.774 --> 00:03:37.295
“Now all of you, get off my mountain!”

65
00:03:39.576 --> 00:03:42.578
Wukong shook his head, pretending to be disappointed.

66
00:03:42.598 --> 00:03:46.040
“I was hoping we could solve this problem nicely.”

67
00:03:46.721 --> 00:03:49.342
He removed the iron bar from his ear.

68
00:03:51.543 --> 00:03:52.444
Red Boy laughed.

69
00:03:53.068 --> 00:03:55.690
“Do you think I’m scared of your little weapon?”

70
00:03:55.710 --> 00:04:00.292
“This iron bar is a treasure from Heaven,” said Wukong.

71
00:04:00.312 --> 00:04:03.154
“It was used to measure the oceans and rivers.

72
00:04:04.014 --> 00:04:07.496
It is very powerful and can do whatever I tell it to do.”

73
00:04:10.218 --> 00:04:12.199
The monkey puffed out his chest.

74
00:04:12.959 --> 00:04:16.681
“Now return the Tang Monk at once, or I’ll destroy your entire mountain!”

75
00:04:16.701 --> 00:04:20.884
“I also have a powerful weapon,” said Red Boy.

76
00:04:22.036 --> 00:04:23.157
“I’ll show it to you.”

77
00:04:24.619 --> 00:04:26.681
The demon punched himself in the nose.

78
00:04:28.463 --> 00:04:32.407
Smoke poured from his nostrils, and fire shot from his mouth.

79
00:04:36.671 --> 00:04:40.135
A moment later flames covered the entire mountainside!
